"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-02-04-19h11m13s754.png", "id": "3910164702587175", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392057_3910164705920508_8933309247422837719_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6GXNMA-x4QUQ7kNvwGW93CU&_nc_oc=Adr6EoQxHZqnsT4yyr40znE2MxnrXh4fNElBxDdVaimbiQOtOiTqwhFim6vY-vQAyRk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSLhOh_REcRjfWlFhrZQj2mkdpkcPZKyYJ1uPUfbejY6g&oe=6B01CE38"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Certified PV Associate", "keywords": ["PV", "Training", "Immerselearn"], "long_description": "Certified PV Associate is a cutting-edge VR training app designed to provide hands-on experience in photovoltaic (PV) systems. This interactive simulation covers:\n\n-PV System Components: Learn about solar panels, inverters, batteries, and other essential components.\n-Different PV Systems: Understand grid-tied, off-grid, and hybrid PV system configurations.\n\nTrain in a realistic, risk-free virtual environment to develop critical skills in solar energy technology, system installation, and maintenance. Whether you're an aspiring solar technician or a professional looking to upskill, Certified PV Associate equips you with the knowledge and practical experience needed for the growing renewable energy industry. Start your training today!", "short_description": "Learn the fundamentals of solar energy with Certified PV Associate! This immersive VR training app provides hands-on experience with PV system components and different types of photovoltaic systems. Train in a realistic virtual environment to enhance technical expertise, improve safety awareness, and develop the skills needed for a successful career in the solar energy industry."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immerselearn", "support_websi